      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Shared rust action treatment.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-rust\">Review the change</button>",
      "css": ".ds-rust{padding:10px 17px;min-height:44px;border:1px solid var(--rust);border-radius:var(--control-radius);font:600 14px/1.4 var(--sans);transition:background 180ms var(--ease),color 180ms var(--ease),border-color 180ms var(--ease);background:var(--rust);color:white;cursor:pointer}.ds-rust:hover{background:var(--rust);border-color:var(--rust)}.ds-rust:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:3px}.ds-rust:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-rust{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-rust"
    },
    {
      "name": "Danger Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Shared danger action treatment.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-danger\">Remove memory</button>",
      "css": ".ds-danger{padding:10px 17px;min-height:44px;border:1px solid #dfb4a7;border-radius:var(--control-radius);font:600 14px/1.4 var(--sans);transition:background 180ms var(--ease),color 180ms var(--ease),border-color 180ms var(--ease);background:var(--white);color:#9c392d;cursor:pointer}.ds-danger:hover{background:#eff0e7;border-color:#dfb4a7}.ds-danger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:3px}.ds-danger:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-danger{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-danger"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Persistent label and readable native input.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-title\">Plan title</label><input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-title\" placeholder=\"An afternoon together\">",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:block;font:600 13px/1.5 var(--sans);margin-bottom:6px}.ds-field{padding:10px 12px;min-height:46px;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #b9c2b7;border-radius:var(--control-radius);font:15px var(--sans)}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Four destinations; desktop underline, mobile lavender active fill.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><button aria-current=\"page\">Explore</button><button>Your day</button><button>Friends</button><button>Memories</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:4px}.ds-nav button{min-height:44px;padding:10px 14px;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:24px;font:500 12px var(--sans);color:#676e61}.ds-nav button[aria-current]{color:var(--green);border-radius:0;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px var(--green)}.ds-nav button:not([aria-current]):hover{background:var(--lightgreen)}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:850px){.ds-nav{background:var(--white,#fff)}.ds-nav button[aria-current]{background:var(--lightgreen,#f1eff6);color:var(--ink,#18191b);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected Filter",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Selected choices remain recognizably interactive.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-filter\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Quiet</button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{min-height:44px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:var(--control-radius);background:var(--green);color:var(--white);font:13px var(--sans)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green);outline-offset:3px}.ds-filter:hover{background:var(--green);color:var(--white)}",
      "refersTo": "selected-filter"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reading Entry",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Continuous editorial content for memories and supporting stories; places use the photo-led treatment below.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-entry\"><h3>An afternoon idea</h3><p>A research lead to explore together.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-entry{padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}.ds-entry h3{margin:0;font:400 28px/1.12 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-entry p{font:15px/1.65 var(--sans)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Places Search and View",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "mobile-search",
      "description": "Flexible mobile search beside accessible 44px map/list controls.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-places-tools\"><label class=\"ds-search\">Search discoveries<input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Places, neighbourhoods, cravings\u2026\"></label><div class=\"ds-views\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Discovery view\"><button aria-label=\"List view\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Map view\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"m3 5 6-2 6 2 6-2v16l-6 2-6-2-6 2Z M9 3v16M15 5v16\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-places-tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:13px var(--sans,sans-serif);color:var(--ink,#18191b)}.ds-search{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-search input{display:block;width:100%;height:48px;padding:0 15px;border:0;border-radius:28px;background:var(--lightgreen,#f1eff6);color:inherit;font:16px var(--sans,sans-serif)}.ds-views{display:flex;flex-shrink:0;gap:4px;padding:3px;background:var(--lightgreen,#f1eff6);border-radius:28px}.ds-views button{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;min-height:44px;border:0;border-radius:24px;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-views button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--green,#202024);color:white}.ds-views button:hover{background:#eff0e7;color:var(--ink,#18191b)}.ds-views button:focus-visible,.ds-search input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#202024);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Place Quick Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "place-quick-action",
      "description": "Map, external Maps search and source links below the summary.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-place-quick\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\"/></svg>Map</button>",
      "css": ".ds-place-quick{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e5e4ea);border-radius:24px;background:var(--lightgreen,#f1eff6);color:var(--ink,#18191b);font:600 12px/1.4 var(--sans,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 180ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-place-quick:hover{border-color:#95a58e}.ds-place-quick:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#202024);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-place-quick{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Place Detail Disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "place-section",
      "description": "Independent experience, practical and research sections; operational warnings remain outside.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-place-section\"><summary>Research &amp; sources<svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><p>Research lead \u00b7 not reverified for your visit</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-place-section{border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e5e4ea);color:var(--ink,#18191b);font:15px/1.65 var(--sans,sans-serif)}.ds-place-section summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;min-height:44px;padding:18px 0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;list-style:none}.ds-place-section[open] summary svg{transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-place-section summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#202024);outline-offset:3px}.ds-place-section p{margin:0 0 20px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Place Invitation",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "mobile-place-action",
      "description": "One 48px invitation action with a day/meeting-point prompt and safe-area padding.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-place-bar\"><button>Invite friends to this</button><span>Choose a day &amp; meeting point</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-place-bar{position:sticky;bottom:0;z-index:5;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 20px max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e5e4ea);background:var(--white,#fff);color:var(--ink,#18191b)}.ds-place-bar button{flex:1;min-height:48px;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid var(--green,#202024);border-radius:28px;background:var(--green,#202024);color:white;font:600 13px/1.4 var(--sans,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-place-bar span{max-width:85px;color:var(--muted,#62616a);font:11px/1.4 var(--sans,sans-serif)}.ds-place-bar button:hover{background:#375c45}.ds-place-bar button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#202024);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Place Card Without Photo",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Actual text-only fallback with an independent save control; no fabricated image.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-place-card\"><button class=\"ds-place-save\" aria-label=\"Save for myself\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M6 3h12v18l-6-4-6 4Z\"/></svg></button><p class=\"ds-place-category\">Tokyo \u00b7 Culture</p><h3><button>A local research lead</button></h3><p class=\"ds-place-copy\">Open the place to read its practical context and sources.</p><p class=\"ds-place-category\">About 60 minutes on site \u00b7 travel extra</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-place-card{position:relative;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#e5e4ea);padding:14px 52px 0 0;color:var(--ink,#18191b);font:14px/1.45 var(--sans,sans-serif)}.ds-place-card .ds-place-save{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lightgreen,#f1eff6);color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-place-category{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#62616a);margin:0 0 5px}.ds-place-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font:700 20px/1.18 \"Inter Display\",var(--sans,sans-serif);letter-spacing:-.025em}.ds-place-card h3 button{min-height:44px;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-place-copy{margin:0 0 10px;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}.ds-place-card button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--green,#202024);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:850px){.ds-place-card h3{font-size:22px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Contemporary journey notebook",
    "overview": "The contemporary journey notebook now has a clean mobile expression: white surfaces, near-black actions, pale lavender controls and compact place photography. Desktop retains warm paper and forest ink. Clear titles, continuous reading surfaces and explicit actions keep the interface calm before a decision and let it recede during travel; dice remain a contained moment of play inside an expandable outing choice.\n\nThis records the implemented friends browser app in this directory, using the current cascade in `public/app.css` and components in `public/app.js` and `public/outings.js`. The accepted Corner-led mobile adaptation and current discovery hierarchy are recorded in `docs/CORNER_MOBILE_RESEARCH.md` and `PRODUCT.md`. The future native application is a separate surface. This document records the current source, not a new product specification. Documentation of an implemented pattern is not evidence of production deployment or completed visual acceptance.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Continuous reading surfaces with separated entries.",
      "Self-hosted Inter Display on place headings; editorial serif titles on other desktop surfaces.",
      "White mobile surfaces, near-black actions and pale lavender secondary controls.",
      "Restrained color with explicit interaction states.",
      "Credited photographs, readable stories and a playable local draw."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Clarity Rule",
        "body": "Pair color with text, selection markers or underlines so the action or state remains explicit.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Task Scale Rule",
        "body": "Keep forms compact: use sans-serif labels and readable controls beneath a restrained task heading.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep repeated entries on one continuous surface; reserve enclosing treatments for a meaningful control, overlay or emphasized supporting panel.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep labels visible and interaction states explicit, including names for icon-only map/list controls.",
      "Do apply the mobile palette only at 850px and below and preserve desktop paper colors.",
      "Do keep private saves, recommendations and invitations separate in both copy and controls.",
      "Do preserve native form values and keyboard behavior when styling selection controls.",
      "Do keep photo credits, reference-image labels and planning uncertainty beside the content they qualify.",
      "Do preserve the distinction between reading, editing, reviewing and publishing an invitation.",
      "Do make private and trip-shared memory choices explicit."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't turn repeated content into a wall of rounded cards.",
      "Don't introduce casino mechanics, neon gaming or a kawaii mascot direction.",
      "Don't inherit legacy decorative eyebrows, text-glyph icons or tiny metadata as rules for new surfaces.",
      "Don't turn declared regional overlap into a proximity or availability claim."
    ]
  }
}
